{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Astral_internal.SLID</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"astral","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Astral_internal","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"SLID","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-expected_sort_of_nil_in_atom\"><a href=\"#val-expected_sort_of_nil_in_atom\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> expected_sort_of_nil_in_atom : <span><a href=\"../SL/index.html#type-t\">SL.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>int <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../Sort/index.html#type-t\">Sort.t</a> option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>expected_sort_of_nil_in_atom atom pos</code> returns the sort which should nil variable have at the position <code>pos</code> in <code>atom</code>.</p><ul class=\"at-tags\"><li class=\"returns\"><span class=\"at-tag\">returns</span> <p>None is returned if the sort cannot be uniquely determined. This is the case for atoms with determined boolean value such as nil = nil or nil |-&gt; &lt;...&gt;.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"at-tags\"><li class=\"raises\"><span class=\"at-tag\">raises</span> <code>Invalid</code> <p>argument if <code>atom</code> is not an atomic formula or <code>pos</code> is out of range of arguments of <code>atom</code>.</p></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-has_unique_footprint\"><a href=\"#val-has_unique_footprint\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> has_unique_footprint : <span><a href=\"../SL/index.html#type-t\">SL.t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec valu